DESCRIPTION:Asheville Comedy Fans\nModelface Comedy Club brings the best c
 omedians from all over the country to Asheville\, NC. This week we are exc
 ited to have local legend Josie Beers!\nJoise Beers Gets Weirds\nInside Jo
 sie Beers are two dragons. One is a 83 year old Korean war vet\, and the o
 ther\, a powerful thirty-something transwoman. After escaping the shutdown
  mines of central Pennsylvania and taming her inner dragons\, she calls WN
 C home.\n\nfeaturing Derek Boskovich\nages 18+\n\nDoors at 6:30pm\, show a
 t 7pm\nTickets $15
