DESCRIPTION:Asheville Comedy Fans\nModelface Comedy Club brings you the be
 st comedians from all over the country!! We have an extra spooky show this
  Halloween with Chris Higgins and friends.\n\nChris Higgins is a stand-up 
 comedian known for his high-energy delivery\, sharp observational humor\, 
 and relatable takes on everyday life. With a natural stage presence and a 
 knack for turning real moments into big laughs\, Chris has performed at cl
 ubs and venues across the country\, quickly building a reputation as a com
 ic audiences love to watch.\n\nFeaturing Worth Osborne\nages 18+\n\nDoors 
